It is a SEPARATE artifact from the CC BY 4.0 snapshot above: the two files are
never merged, and Pictorium uses this own DB only as a fallback when the
CC BY 4.0 snapshot has no record for a series.

Changes made by this project: the published Pictorium-format snapshot was
vendored unmodified by scripts/update-anime-filler-own-map.mjs, which validates
the schema before writing. The upstream export already range-compresses its
